# RESETIUS |   Angle 4
# RESETIUS |   Axiom otuz
# RESETIUS |   f=
# RESETIUS |   o=fo+f-t
# RESETIUS |   p=++f--u+f-x
# RESETIUS |   q=-f+v++f--q
